{"ext":"u2-2","dialogue":{"type":"dialogue","instruction":"La Granjera Mia te muestra sus cosas. Lee el chat y elige la respuesta correcta en cada turno.","persona":"Granjera Mia","turns":[{"npc":"Look at my house! What color is it?","options":[{"text":"The house is green.","correct":true},{"text":"The house are green.","correct":false},{"text":"The green is house.","correct":false}]},{"npc":"Yes! And I have many blocks. How many do you see?","options":[{"text":"I see five block.","correct":false},{"text":"I see five blocks.","correct":true},{"text":"I see blocks five.","correct":false}]},{"npc":"Great! This sword is very big. Is your sword big too?","options":[{"text":"No, my sword is small.","correct":true},{"text":"No, my sword small.","correct":false},{"text":"No, my small sword.","correct":false}]},{"npc":"Nice! Look at this diamond. How is it?","options":[{"text":"It is a diamond shiny.","correct":false},{"text":"It is shiny diamond a.","correct":false},{"text":"It is a shiny diamond.","correct":true}]}]}}